  "details": "**# Description**\n\nI would like to request the implementation of a permission system for placing portals within worlds created for events. This feature would ensure that only users with instance owner privileges or those who have the necessary permissions within a group can place portals. The primary reason for this is to prevent non-event staff from placing portals, which can lead to misunderstandings, accidental entries, disrupt the smooth progression of the event, and potentially cause participants to be unable to rejoin.\n\n**# Benefits**\n\nEnhanced Event Management:\n\nEnsures that only authorized personnel can manage portal placements, maintaining the integrity of the event setup.\n\nReduced Confusion:\n\nPrevents unauthorized portals from causing misunderstandings or accidental entries by participants.\n\nSmooth Event Flow:\n\nMinimizes disruptions by restricting portal placement to designated staff, ensuring the event proceeds as planned.\n\nImproved Participant Experience:\n\nAvoids scenarios where participants cannot rejoin the event due to unauthorized portal placements.\n\nThank you for your consideration.",
